    "theorem": "ThreeTorsionCharThreeAudit.original_three_source_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem original_three_source_certificate : (∀ (F L : Type) [Field F] [Fintype F] [Field L] [Algebra F L] [DecidableEq F] [DecidableEq L] [IsAlgClosed L] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F), W.Δ≠0 → 3 ∣ Nat.card W.Point → ¬3 ∣ Fintype.card F-1 → ∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Fintype K] [Algebra F K] [Algebra K L] [IsScalarTower F K L] [DecidableEq K], ∀ k : ℕ, Fintype.card K=Fintype.card F^k → (Nat.card (ThreeTorsion (W.baseChange K))=9 ↔ 3 ∣ Fintype.card F^k-1)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] [CharP K 3] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K), W.Δ≠0 → (Nat.card (ThreeTorsion W)=1 ∨ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion W)=3) ∧ Finite (ThreeTorsion W) ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion W)≠9 ∧ (Module.finrank (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion W)=0 ∨ Module.finrank (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion W)=1)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] [CharP K 3] (a b : K), (ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.curve a b).Δ≠0 → Nat.card (ThreeTorsion (ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.curve a b))=3) ∧ ((ThreeTorsionRankAudit.short (-1:ThreeTorsionRankAudit.CharThreeClosure) 0).Δ≠0 ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion (ThreeTorsionRankAudit.short (-1:ThreeTorsionRankAudit.CharThreeClosure) 0))=1 ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion (ThreeTorsionRankAudit.short (-1:ThreeTorsionRankAudit.CharThreeClosure) 0))≠9) ∧ (ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.ordinaryBase.Δ≠0 ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion (ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.curve (1:ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.OrdinaryClosure) 1))=3 ∧ Module.finrank (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion (ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.curve (1:ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.OrdinaryClosure) 1))=1)",
    "decl_sha256": "74e11c778d8f1080d20c9897db3a9cd4cf4da901b758c86599e6c2ce56e9a56d",
    "scope": "Original Balasubramanian–Koblitz prime3 nine-point criterion withoutcoprime: everyfinitefield/arbitrarynonsingularWeierstrassmodel/actualrationalpointcarddivisible3/qnot1mod3/everychosencompatibleextensionq^k. Exactly9killed3points includingidentity iff3|q^k−1. Generalchar3actualkilled3groupcard1or3/finiteness/inducedZMod3modulefinrank0or1 overeveryfield. Actualnormalization and explicitnormalformsubgroupbijection; trivialbranchactualsingleton; finiteCauchy derivescoprimeoutsidechar3, char3bothsidesfalse. Creditedactualcard1/card3controls. No normalization/rank/determinant/pairing/characteristicpremise in originalsourceform. Inclusion formremainsqualified. Otherprimes>=5/canonicalWeil/fullallkp500/all14remainopen; no supersingularityclassification/fullpaper/bookread/novelty/corpuspromotion/nativeexperiment/spend/upload.",
